{"id":"97682","t":{"th":null,"ro":"Zero kara Hajimeru Mahou no Sho","en":"Grimoire of Zero","na":"ゼロから始める魔法の書"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx97682-YRhTwV979zSr.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx97682-YRhTwV979zSr.jpg","color":"#43bbe4","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/97682-HgEodWuTgFgS.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":25,"season":"SPRING","year":2017,"start":"2017-04-10","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy"],"score":68,"pop":71034,"studio":"WHITE FOX","desc":"The \"grimoire fantasy\" series follows a witch named Zero who is ignorant of the world and a half-beast half-human mercenary who longs to be human. Witches who practice sorcery exist in the world, however, in this era no one knows how about the art and study of witchcraft. Zero is going on a journey to search for a magical tome called \"The Book of Zero\" that hides a power that can destroy the world. The mercenary travels with her as her guard.","descTh":"ซีรีส์ \"grimoire fantasy\" ติดตามแม่มดชื่อ Zero ผู้ไม่รู้โลกและทหารรับจ้างครึ่งสัตว์ครึ่งมนุษย์ที่ใฝ่ฝันที่จะเป็นมนุษย์ แม่มดผู้ฝึกฝนเวทมนตร์นั้นมีอยู่ในโลก อย่างไรก็ตาม ในยุคนี้ไม่มีใครรู้เกี่ยวกับศิลปะและการศึกษาเวทมนตร์ Zero กำลังออกเดินทางเพื่อค้นหาหนังสือเวทย์มนตร์ที่เรียกว่า \"The Book of Zero\" ที่ซ่อนพลังที่สามารถทำลายโลกได้ ทหารรับจ้างเดินทางไปกับเธอในฐานะผู้พิทักษ์","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"-6QDVRnxf9g","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/97682","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/34176","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"muse_asia","r":"ASIA","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwLSw1_eDZl2CqcAM38QNk6I65Dz9PRie","lang":"en","eps":[["7","y:71j6M-w6-1Y",1730259210,"~",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[133.5,221.6],[1317.9,1410.1]]}],["8","y:qI1AsNYjDQM",1730259210,"~",null,null,{"d":1420,"sk":[[68.1,156.2],[1317.6,1410.1]]}],["9","y:KXQbrCp1A9s",17302592